description:
Page links for a long list: a `<nav>` landmark around a row of links you lay out yourself - or let PaginationPages build the truncated range for you.

  Pagination do
    PaginationList do
      PaginationItem { PaginationLink(href: "?page=1", active: true) { "1" } }
      PaginationItem { PaginationLink(href: "?page=2") { "2" } }
      PaginationItem { PaginationEllipsis() }
    end
  end

  Pagination { PaginationPages(page: @page, pages: @pages) { |page| posts_path(page:) } }

`variant:` (:outline, :soft) and `size:` flow to every link.

examples.code:
phlex do
  Pagination do
    PaginationList do
      PaginationItem { PaginationLink(href: "#!", icon: true, disabled: true, aria_label: "Go to previous page") { Icon(:chevron_left) } }
      PaginationItem { PaginationLink(href: "#!", active: true) { "1" } }
      PaginationItem { PaginationLink(href: "#!") { "2" } }
      PaginationItem { PaginationLink(href: "#!") { "3" } }
      PaginationItem { PaginationEllipsis() }
      PaginationItem { PaginationLink(href: "#!") { "10" } }
      PaginationItem { PaginationLink(href: "#!", icon: true, aria_label: "Go to next page") { Icon(:chevron_right) } }
    end
  end
end
